WEBVTT

00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:31.450
she didn't dwell on it.

00:08:31.474 --> 00:08:34.246
She simply gave me
permission to be myself

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.164
and made a human connection.

00:08:37.594 --> 00:08:39.793
This was her version of empathy,

00:08:39.817 --> 00:08:41.771
of which I'm sure there are many.

00:08:42.162 --> 00:08:45.243
But not everybody
is a natural with empathy,

00:08:45.267 --> 00:08:48.681
and traditional work cultures
don't always emphasize empathy.

00:08:49.245 --> 00:08:51.434
One person said to me,

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:53.459
"I can't believe you made it back to work.

00:08:53.483 --> 00:08:55.244
I don't think I could have done it."

00:08:56.226 --> 00:08:58.489
Boy, did that make me feel awful.

00:08:59.144 --> 00:09:01.715
Is my love for my child not strong?